---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Privacy — Greedy Growers Hub" description="How Greedy Growers Hub handles technical and usage data." canonicalPath="/privacy" noindex>
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-14 sm:px-8 sm:py-20">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-leaf-400">Site policy</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-bold tracking-[-.04em] sm:text-5xl">Privacy</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-sand-300">Last reviewed: July 27, 2026</p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 leading-7 text-sand-300">
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-sand-100">What this MVP collects</h2><p class="mt-3">You can use the public guides, seed explorer, and calculator without creating an account. Calculator entries and seed comparisons are processed in your browser and are not submitted to our server by those tools.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-sand-100">Basic technical data</h2><p class="mt-3">A hosting provider may process ordinary request information such as an IP address, browser details, requested page, and request time for delivery, security, and reliability.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-sand-100">Microsoft Clarity analytics</h2><p class="mt-3">We use Microsoft Clarity to understand how visitors use the site, including page views, clicks, scrolling, device and browser details, and session behavior. Clarity may use cookies where permitted. Microsoft handles this data under the <a class="text-leaf-400 underline" href="https://privacy.microsoft.com/en-us/privacystatement" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Microsoft Privacy Statement</a>.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-sand-100">External services</h2><p class="mt-3">The site links to Roblox and public community sources. Opening those links is governed by their policies. Web fonts may be requested from Google, and the server-side status endpoint requests public experience data from the Roblox Games API.</p></section>
      <section><h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-sand-100">Changes and questions</h2><p class="mt-3">This notice will be updated if accounts, advertising, a contact form, or other data-processing services are added. The current contact-channel status is published on the <a class="text-leaf-400 underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p></section>
    </div>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
